# InstaFeedClone – Social Feed App

InstaFeedClone is a simple social media application built with Flutter. Users can explore posts through a clean and easy-to-use feed interface.

The app uses Flutter, Bloc state management, Clean Architecture, and dependency injection with get_it. The architecture separates the presentation, domain, and data layers, making the application easier to maintain and extend.

### Key Features

* Clean and simple user interface
* Social media style post feed
* Efficient ListView.builder
* Bloc-based state management
* Loading and error handling
* Clean Architecture
* Dependency Injection using get_it
